      "name": "MCP Stdio Bridge",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "summary": "Model Context Protocol JSON-RPC 2.0 message framer and stdio transport adapter",
      "description": "## MCP Stdio Bridge\n\nImplements line-delimited and Content-Length framed JSON-RPC 2.0 transport for Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers and clients communicating over process standard I/O streams.\n\n### Highlights\n- Strict JSON-RPC 2.0 request/response/notification framing\n- Streaming parser with buffer chunk reassembly\n- Request ID matching with Promise callbacks and timeouts\n- Zero external runtime dependencies",
