      "name": "Biometric Keychain Vault",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "summary": "Platform-agnostic biometric authentication and encrypted credential storage interface",
      "description": "## Biometric Keychain Vault\n\nProvides a secure, platform-agnostic abstraction for storing authentication tokens and credentials guarded by biometric authorization (Touch ID, Face ID, Windows Hello) with software fallbacks for headless/CI environments.\n\n### Capabilities\n- Biometric gating on read/write operations\n- Secure PBKDF2/AES-GCM encryption in software mode\n- Token rotation and automatic invalidation\n- Zero third-party dependencies",
