      "name": "Precision Cron Scheduler",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "summary": "In-memory precision job scheduler with drift compensation, jitter, and retry backoff",
      "description": "## Precision Cron Scheduler\n\nA resilient, memory-efficient background task runner featuring millisecond drift correction, configurable randomized jitter to prevent thundering herd spikes, and automated exponential backoff on failure.\n\n### Highlights\n- Interval and recurring timer execution with drift compensation\n- Randomized jitter window to spread API bursts\n- Execution history ring buffer and success/failure metrics\n- Graceful cancellation and cleanup\n- Zero external runtime dependencies",
